[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0845","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0845.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1220","title":"Linux lpr 行式打印机守护进程本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中 lpr 软件包的行式打印机守护进程（lpd）存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 lpd 提交特制的打印任务，诱使其调用 sendmail 时传递任意命令行参数（如使用 -C 选项指定恶意配置文件），从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多种 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1220"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-01-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24.513","remediation":"立即升级 lpr 软件包至修复版本：Red Hat Linux 6.x 升级至 lpr-0.48-1，5.x 升级至 lpr-0.48-0.5.2，4.x 升级至 lpr-0.48-0.4.2；Debian 系统应用 2000 年 1 月 9 日安全更新。如无法立即升级，建议禁用 LPD 服务（`chkconfig lpd off` 或 `systemctl disable lpd`）并在防火墙层面阻止 515 端口入站流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/lists/bugtraq/2000/Jan/0116.html","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/lpd_advisory.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000109","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/39001","http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/lpd_advisory","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-002.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/927","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/325","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1220.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1220","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/0a0ee018a505a462b1fc34464a6c520611d3ad78/2001/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xc7-h5vr-gqmj/GHSA-4xc7-h5vr-gqmj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1220.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1583.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0845.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0198","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0061","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 安全区域设置延迟漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 存在安全区域设置延迟漏洞。当浏览器加载文档时，系统在文档完全加载完成前未能正确应用安全区域限制，导致远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，在文档加载过程中以不同的安全上下文执行 JavaScript 脚本，从而绕过 IE 的安全区域隔离机制。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.0、4.0.1、5.0、5.0.1 及 5.5 Preview 版本，CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，可导致信息泄露、权限提升等严重后果。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0061"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-07T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55.253","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 至 6.0 及以上版本（IE 6.0 于 2001 年发布，已修复该时间窗口问题）。鉴于当前 IE 已停止支持，建议迁移至 Microsoft Edge 或基于 Chromium 的现代浏览器，同时在环境中禁用 IE 兼容模式及 ActiveX 以彻底规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0061","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0061.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0061.json","https://github.com/biggerwing/nsfocus-rsas-knowledge-base/blob/156208b301d4649ead13cd15f827830d08245b89/example","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2w55-jm9h-8pcw/GHSA-2w55-jm9h-8pcw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0061.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0106","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0044","title":"War FTP 远程代码执行与任意文件读取漏洞","description":"War FTP daemon (warftpd) 1.70 及 1.67b2 版本的宏功能存在安全缺陷，本地或远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务发送特制的宏命令，绕过权限限制读取任意文件或执行系统命令。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前厂商已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的 FTP 服务器软件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0044"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53.137","remediation":"立即升级 War FTP Daemon 至 1.72 或更高版本，该版本已修复宏功能中的输入验证缺陷。若无法升级，在服务端配置文件中禁用宏解析功能（MacrosEnabled=false），并在防火墙中限制对 21 端口的访问为仅受信任 IP 段。同时避免将 FTP 服务暴露在公网。作为进一步缓解措施，建议迁移至更活跃维护的 FTP 服务端软件如 vsftpd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/919","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0044","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0044.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0044.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3346902a1d1e44903f43a6ca4d63e2601447c63c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qhw5-79xh-589g/GHSA-qhw5-79xh-589g.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0044.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cee5a3b524678beb8613152453ffdb7e3eac41b4/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0070","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0084","title":"CuteFTP 密码信息弱加密存储漏洞","description":"CuteFTP 使用弱加密算法将 FTP 服务器登录密码存储在本地 `tree.dat` 文件中，攻击者在获取目标系统本地文件访问权限后，可读取 `tree.dat` 文件并利用弱加密的可逆性还原明文密码，从而窃取用户的 FTP 登录凭据。该漏洞影响 CuteFTP 全系版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危漏洞。用户应升级至官方最新版本或避免在共享/多用户环境下使用该软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0084"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58.020","remediation":"立即升级 CuteFTP 至 4.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复弱加密存储密码问题。如无法升级，建议停止使用 tree.dat 存储密码，改用其他安全 FTP 客户端（如 FileZilla）替代，并清除已保存的密码记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0084","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0084.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0084","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/922354cca15ef3923415d02f4397f929a0208531/2000/CVE-2000-0084.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0084.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2c8m-gphg-q96w/GHSA-2c8m-gphg-q96w.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0084.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88218/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0046","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0055","title":"Solaris chkperm 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中的 chkperm 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 -n 选项传递超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出进而覆盖内存中的关键数据，最终获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 系统，攻击者需拥有本地账户才能利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0055"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.510","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方补丁 106327-01 (Solaris 2.6) 或 106725-01 (Solaris 7)。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod 0555 /bin/chkperm` 移除 setuid 位，阻止非授权用户提权利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/918","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0055.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0055","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0055.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0055.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jpp8-gj33-w52q/GHSA-jpp8-gj33-w52q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/918/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0055.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3f0ec3d0-95c4-4a6c-82ea-cedb1bef5a02.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0048","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0058","title":"The user wants me to generate a title field for CVE-2000-0058. Let me analyze the information: - Product: Handspring Visor - Feature: Network HotSync - Issue: No authentication, allowing remote attackers to retrieve email and files - This is an authentication bypass vulnerability The format should be: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" Manufacturer: Handspring (Handspring公司) Product: Visor (Visor掌上电脑) Vulnerability type: 认证缺失漏洞 / 远程信息泄露漏洞 Let me think about the best translation: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞\" or \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 远程信息泄露漏洞\" The core issue is that Network HotSync has no authentication, allowing remote attackers to retrieve email and files. So it's an authentication bypass / missing authentication vulnerability. I'll go with something like: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞\" Actually, let me look at the original title more carefully: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync漏洞\" - this is the AVD title. The NVD description says: \"Network HotSync program in Handspring Visor does not have authentication, which allows remote attackers to retrieve email and files.\" So it's an authentication bypass / missing authentication vulnerability leading to information disclosure. Title: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞\" That's concise and follows the format: manufacturer \"Handspring\", product \"Visor Network HotSync\", vulnerability type \"认证缺失漏洞\".Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞 <value","description":"Handspring Visor 移动设备的 Network HotSync 程序缺乏身份认证机制，远程攻击者可在同一网络段内直接连接目标设备的 HotSync 服务端口，无需任何凭证即可越权访问设备中的电子邮件、联系人、日历等个人数据文件。该漏洞影响 Handspring Visor 系列掌上设备，攻击者仅需与目标处于同一网络即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0058"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-05T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.883","remediation":"Handspring Visor 已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议禁用 Network HotSync 功能，仅在需要时临时开启；在防火墙上限制 14238/TCP 端口的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接；避免在不受信任的网络（如公共 Wi-Fi）上使用 HotSync 同步功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.security-express.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-01/0085.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/920","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0058.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0058","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0058.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0058.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7m79-fmrv-9w39/GHSA-7m79-fmrv-9w39.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/920/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0058.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/pre2008/hotsync.nasl","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001087.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e23a9add9eb7a204c43e0b2a3d73e474ee508d84/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0047","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0056","title":"Ipswitch IMail IMonitor status.cgi 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 5.0.8/6.0/6.1 版本中的 IMonitor 组件 status.cgi CGI 脚本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向该脚本发送大量请求导致服务资源耗尽，造成 IMail 邮件服务拒绝服务。此漏洞影响 Ipswitch IMail 5.0.8、6.0 及 6.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0056"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-05T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.633","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.2 或更高版本以修复该漏洞；如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面限制对 `/cgi-bin/status.cgi` 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 通过防火墙规则访问 IMonitor 服务端口（默认为 8383），并限制单个 IP 的请求速率以缓解 DoS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/914","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19711","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0056.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0056","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0056.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0056.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wp6p-mrc4-c787/GHSA-wp6p-mrc4-c787.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0056.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/imail_imonitor_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0047.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0047.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0222","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0085","title":"Microsoft Hotmail 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Hotmail 未对用户邮件中的 JavaScript 代码进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过向受害者发送包含恶意 IMG 标签的特制邮件触发漏洞，当受害者使用 Hotmail 打开邮件时，LOWSRC 或 DYNRC 参数中嵌入的恶意脚本将在浏览器中自动执行，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Hotmail 网页邮件服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0085"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58.153","remediation":"微软已通过服务器端更新修复此漏洞，方案包括：1) 对 IMG 标签的 LOWSRC 和 DYNRC 属性实施严格的输入过滤，禁止嵌入 JavaScript 代码；2) 启用 HTML 邮件内容安全策略（CSP），阻止内联脚本执行；3) 建议用户启用邮件纯文本模式，在 Outlook.com 设置中关闭 HTML 渲染作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0085","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0085","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/922354cca15ef3923415d02f4397f929a0208531/2000/CVE-2000-0085.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0085.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f4j7-89mf-xg78/GHSA-f4j7-89mf-xg78.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0085.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/hotmail_cve.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0222.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0168","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0059","title":"PHP PHP 3.0.13 Safe Mode 绕过漏洞","description":"PHP 3.0.13 的 safe_mode 功能在调用 popen 执行命令时未能正确过滤 shell 元字符，远程攻击者可通过向使用 popen 函数且开启 safe_mode 的 PHP 应用程序提交特制输入，注入恶意 shell 命令并执行，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 PHP 3.0.13 版本，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级严重。目前官方已停止维护该版本，建议升级至修复版本或关闭 safe_mode 并采用其他安全措施。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0059"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55.000","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 3.0.14 或更高版本，该版本修复了 popen() 函数在 safe_mode 开启时未正确过滤 shell 元字符的问题。如无法升级，应禁用 popen()、exec()、system() 等命令执行函数，并对所有用户输入进行严格的 escapeshellarg() 过滤，避免直接传入 shell 环境。长期方案应迁移至受支持的 PHP 版本（如 8.x），并停用已废弃的 safe_mode 机制，改用正规权限控制方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/911","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19708","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0059","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0059.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0059.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/PHP3%20'safe_mode'%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2000-0059).html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qq3m-73fj-v56q/GHSA-qq3m-73fj-v56q.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0059.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e24da15d-1372-4be7-a3a5-8f73b3ffc015.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0111","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0057","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server CFCACHE 标签缓存文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.0 及 4.0.1 版本中的 CFCACHE 标签会将临时缓存文件存放于 Web 文档根目录下，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接访问这些缓存文件，从而获取包含数据库连接信息、源代码路径等在内的敏感系统信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响 ColdFusion 4.x 系列版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0057"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.753","remediation":"升级至 ColdFusion 4.5 及以上版本以修复 CFCACHE 标签缓存文件泄露问题；若无法升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）配置中禁止访问 /CFCACHE/ 目录及所有 .cfm 缓存文件，或将缓存目录移至 Web 根目录之外。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=13978&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/917","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19712","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0057","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0a309958ebbad3dacba1bf7fdb76896365afc06f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-00xx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0e77f8a024b0f1e940623a2d9b4240b792512f14/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/e8beafdc87407b6ccd406c377327b8bfe727cd66/api/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0111.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0109","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0053","title":"Microsoft Commercial Internet System IMAP 服务器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Commercial Internet System (MCIS) 2.0 及 2.5 版本中的 IMAP 服务存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的畸形 IMAP 请求报文，触发服务组件在处理请求时发生异常，从而导致 IMAP 服务进程崩溃并拒绝为合法用户提供服务。该漏洞可被用于对部署了 MCIS 邮件服务的系统实施拒绝服务攻击，影响范围涉及使用 MCIS 的 Windows 服务器环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0053"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.267","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-001 提供的补丁。Intel 平台补丁下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?familyid=03140610-f69c-4d34-b441-32c1a2abb1ed；Alpha 平台补丁下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?familyid=2cc2d73f-8493-4b8a-9e47-93673a522e70。由于 MCIS 已停止支持，如无法安装补丁，应在防火墙限制对 IMAP 服务（TCP 143 端口）的访问，仅允许受信 IP 范围连接，并迁移至受支持的邮件服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ246731","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/912","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-001","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0053.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0053.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0053","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0053.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0053.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4r76-hhh5-w3m9/GHSA-4r76-hhh5-w3m9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0053.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001081.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0045","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0052","title":"Red Hat userhelper PAM 路径遍历本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux usermode 软件包中的 userhelper 程序存在路径遍历漏洞，本地用户可利用 PAM 模块结合 ..（点点）目录跳转攻击绕过权限检查，从而获取 root 超级用户权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat 6.x、Mandrake 6.x 及 Turbolinux 3.5 b2/4.x/6.0.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需额外认证即可实施提权攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0052"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.140","remediation":"立即升级 usermode 软件包至 1.28 及以上版本（对应 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2000-001），该修复禁止 userhelper 处理包含 .. 的 PAM 配置文件路径参数。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 /usr/sbin/userhelper 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/userhelper），阻断普通用户以 root 权限执行 userhelper 的利用路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/pam_advisory","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/913","http://xforce.iss.net/search.php3?type=2&pattern=linux-pam-userhelper","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19710","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0052.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0052.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0052","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0052.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cxvc-f794-62r9/GHSA-cxvc-f794-62r9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0052.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--57ff4e67-7202-4608-8a13-7b344961a16b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0045.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0045.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0043","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0051","title":"Allaire Spectra 1.0 Configuration Wizard 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 1.0 的配置向导存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送恶意的 URL 请求，反复提交数据集合进行索引操作，导致服务器资源耗尽，从而使服务不可用。该漏洞影响 Allaire Spectra 1.0 版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0051"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54.023","remediation":"限制对 Allaire Spectra Configuration Wizard 的访问，通过 Web 服务器（如 IIS）或防火墙配置仅允许受信任 IP 访问 /spectra/config/ 路径。在生产环境中彻底禁用或移除 Configuration Wizard 组件，防止外部通过 URL 重复提交索引请求导致拒绝服务。如无法禁用，在 Web 服务器层面对该路径添加请求频率限制（rate limiting）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=13977&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/916","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0051.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0051","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0051.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0051.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h8v4-hxvg-rx8v/GHSA-h8v4-hxvg-rx8v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0051.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001079.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e23a9add9eb7a204c43e0b2a3d73e474ee508d84/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0043.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0042","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0050","title":"Allaire Spectra Webtop 授权绕过漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 1.0 Webtop 存在访问控制缺陷漏洞，经过身份认证的攻击者可通过在浏览器地址栏中直接输入其他 Webtop 分区的显式 URL，绕过应用内置的导航权限限制，越权访问本无权限查看的敏感功能模块和页面内容。该漏洞源于服务端对用户会话权限的校验不充分，仅依赖前端界面隐藏进行访问控制。攻击者只需拥有普通用户账号即可利用，无需特殊工具。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0050"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53.890","remediation":"立即安装 Allaire 官方针对 Spectra 1.0 的安全补丁（公告 ID: ASB00-001），该补丁修复了 URL 直接访问绕过权限检查的问题。如无法安装补丁，可通过 Web 服务器（如 IIS）的 URL 重写规则限制对 Webtop 各分节的直接路径访问，仅允许通过主入口页面导航。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=13976&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/915","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0050","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0050.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964